table 'dates between start&end'
	lineageTag: 4992c3a0-47e8-46ef-9a78-2be89cdfd1c1

	measure YTDConsumption = ```
			
			        CALCULATE(          
			            SUM('dates between start&end'[quantity]),          
			            FILTER(          
			                ALLSELECTED('dates between start&end'[usage_date]),     
			                'dates between start&end'[usage_date] <= MAX('dates between start&end'[usage_date]) 
			        )
			)
			```
		lineageTag: a29d11fc-a639-47f7-9b9f-4239889170d1

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

